{
  "boardName": "Pad Groove",
  "description": "A four-chord song with no picture: a pad, a bass line and a drum groove, all arranged on one timeline.\n\nThe **Song** is a timeline that counts in **beats** — eight bars, thirty-two beats, looping — at the tempo held in the **Tempo** slot. Its placements say when each part plays: the `pad` throughout, the `hats` from the third bar, the `bass` and the `kick` from the fifth, the `snare` from the seventh and a `fill` in the last two beats.\n\nEvery part is a track in the **Band**, and a use of one of two blocks. **Notes** is a timeline that loops a few beats of its own with an action for every note, and a synth that plays the notes a frame carries — several at one moment are a chord. The pad is Notes with a soft wave, a slow attack and a long release, one chord a bar, held for the bar and fading into the next; the bass is Notes with a triangle wave and short notes. **Drum** is the Night Groove's: a loop of hits and a drum.\n\nThe pad and the bass each loop four bars, and the bass comes in where the pad's loop starts over, so their chords agree. Note lengths are in beats too, so turning the tempo stretches the chords with the bars.",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "notes",
      "name": "Notes",
      "serviceId": "sub-service",
      "description": "Notes on a loop of their own: each is an action on a timeline of `length` beats, and every frame some fall in plays them together on one synth — several notes at one moment are a chord. Each note is held for `hold` beats of the tempo the frame carries. It plays while its name is placed and repeats for as long as the placement lasts.",
      "params": {
        "name": "notes",
        "length": 4,
        "notes": [
          {
            "at": 0,
            "data": {
              "note": "A3"
            }
          }
        ],
        "wave": "soft",
        "volume": 0.3,
        "attack": 0.01,
        "hold": 1,
        "release": 0.1
      },
      "state": {
        "pipeline": [
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/timeline",
            "instanceId": "loop",
            "serviceName": "Loop",
            "state": {
              "clock": "input",
              "length": "{{param.length}}",
              "loop": true,
              "actions": "{{param.notes}}",
              "placement": "{{param.name}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/filter",
            "instanceId": "on-a-note",
            "serviceName": "On a note",
            "state": {
              "conditions": [
                "params.actions.length > 0"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/map",
            "instanceId": "the-notes",
            "serviceName": "Notes and tempo",
            "state": {
              "mode": "replace",
              "template": {
                "notes=": "params.actions",
                "tempo=": "params.tempo"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/sound",
            "instanceId": "synth",
            "serviceName": "Synth",
            "state": {
              "generator": "synth",
              "waveType": "{{param.wave}}",
              "volume": "{{param.volume}}",
              "attack": "{{param.attack}}",
              "noteDuration": "{{param.hold}}",
              "noteDurationUnit": "beats",
              "release": "{{param.release}}"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "drum",
      "name": "Drum",
      "serviceId": "sub-service",
      "description": "One drum on a loop of its own: the hits lie on a timeline of `length` beats, and every frame one falls in plays the drum. It plays while its name is placed and repeats for as long as the placement lasts.",
      "params": {
        "name": "drum",
        "sound": "kick",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "length": 1,
        "hits": [
          {
            "at": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "state": {
        "pipeline": [
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/timeline",
            "instanceId": "loop",
            "serviceName": "Loop",
            "state": {
              "clock": "input",
              "length": "{{param.length}}",
              "loop": true,
              "actions": "{{param.hits}}",
              "placement": "{{param.name}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/filter",
            "instanceId": "on-a-hit",
            "serviceName": "On a hit",
            "state": {
              "conditions": [
                "params.actions.length > 0"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "serviceId": "hookup.to/service/sound",
            "instanceId": "sound",
            "serviceName": "Sound",
            "state": {
              "generator": "drums",
              "trigger": "{{param.sound}}",
              "volume": "{{param.volume}}"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
